AURORA OS is a live desktop image assembled from Ubuntu 26.04 LTS and the
open-source packages recorded in build/live-build/config/package-lists.
Those packages remain under their own licenses; their copyright files are
installed in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright inside the image.

The AURORA name, logo, wallpaper, login artwork, documentation, build system,
and distribution configuration are the work credited above.
